# Workstations API – REST Client
#
# Endpoints: /workstations
# Purpose:
# - Kitchen/bar preparation stations for order routing.
# - Categories/products are assigned to stations so orders go to the right prep area.
#
# Auth / cookies:
# - If your API uses Better Auth cookie sessions, keep @cookieJar consistent across files.
# - Origin protection: include Origin + Referer headers on protected routes.
#
# Usage flow:
# 1) Run Auth login in auth.http (stores cookie in jar)
# 2) Run requests here (cookie is reused via the same jar name)
#
# Notes:
# - Replace {{workstationId}} with a UUID from list/create responses.
# - If your API is mounted under /api, set @apiPrefix = /api

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@cookieJar = betterauth

# If your server mounts routes under /api, set this to /api. Otherwise leave empty.
@apiPrefix = /api

# IDs (paste values from responses)
@workstationId = 822a1d97-d515-4de6-8271-1c33ba8842f0


### List all workstations - ok
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/workstations
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### Retrieve a workstation by id - ok
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/workstations/{{workstationId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### Retrieve a workstation with assigned categories 
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/workstations/{{workstationId}}/categories
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### Retrieve a workstation with categories and products (detailed)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/workstations/{{workstationId}}/detailed
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/


### Create a workstation - ok
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/workstations
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "name": "Main",
  "description": "Main workstation"
}

### Patch/update a workstation (only include fields you want to change) - ok
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/workstations/{{workstationId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "name": "Kitchen - Main"
}

### Delete a workstation - ok
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/workstations/{{workstationId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/
